        <main>
          
            <blockquote class="warning">
  <p><strong>Heads up:</strong> This endpoint is part of the legacy V3 API, which is being phased out. An actively maintained equivalent is available in V5 under the source <a href="/delphi-epidata/api/v5-signals/fluview_ilinet.html"><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">fluview_ilinet</code></a>. See the <a href="/delphi-epidata/api/v5_migration.html">V3/V4 to V5 Migration Guide</a> for full details.</p>
</blockquote>
<h1 class="no_toc" id="fluview-ilinet">
  
  
    <a href="#fluview-ilinet" class="anchor-heading" aria-labelledby="fluview-ilinet"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#svg-link"></use></svg></a> FluView (ILINet)
  
  
</h1>
    

<div class="table-wrapper"><table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="text-align: left">Attribute</th>
      <th style="text-align: left">Details</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
