      <td style="text-align: left"><strong>Data Source</strong></td>
      <td style="text-align: left"><a href="http://gis.cdc.gov/grasp/fluview/fluportaldashboard.html">United States Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)</a></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="text-align: left"><strong>Geographic Levels</strong></td>
      <td style="text-align: left">National, Department of Health &amp; Human Services (HHS) Regions, Census Divisions, State (see <a href="/delphi-epidata/api/geographic_codes.html#us-regions-and-states">Geographic Codes</a>), Cities (see <a href="/delphi-epidata/api/geographic_codes.html#fluview-cities">FluView Cities</a>)</td>
    </tr>
